                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "The emphasis is\nrecorded. It is a\ndirection you\nchose with the\nsame",
                                  "protections\nintact, not a\nhidden score. All\nthat remains is\nthe",
                                  "final service\ncheck and the\nfestival switch.\nPip has reduced\nhis",
                                  "speech to one\npage, with only\none ambitious\nadjective."
