                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "The launch crowd\nis a clerk, a\nforeman, several\ncouriers, two",
                                  "roofers, and\npeople who have\nwaited a long time\nfor someone to\nadmit",
                                  "what went wrong.\nThe ribbon is\nmodest. The switch\nis ordinary. For",
                                  "once, the ordinary\nthing deserves the\nattention."
